abstract: >-
  A learning platform for bioinformatics. Standalone, human-reviewed topic pages are woven into
  routes toward a learner's goal by walking their declared prerequisites, with AI drafting pages
  and connecting text under review. Part of the comeni-project, beside Comeni Labs.
